  click S_NEW href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L530" "NudgeTask.init(title:dueDate:dueTime:specificTime:…sequenceIndex:). Arrows out are labeled with the chat capture; the same moves are made by TaskEditorSheet create (unplanned, day, manual), acceptGoalOffer (unplanned), ExamPrepSweep.commitmentPhase (unplanned: a daily owed at 23:59), CalendarService applyImportedSchedule (day, or manual with a span), PlanProposalSweep.accept (day), ScreenshotCalendarImporter.importFromImage (event). See the two creation close-ups." _blank
  click S_UNPLANNED href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L151" "No plan day, no plan time. Lists: Unscheduled (isUnscheduled) unless the deadline falls today, in which case belongs(to: today) puts it in Today; also Overdue once sortDeadline passes. A deadline may or may not exist; skipCount may be 1 or more after a rollover release, shown as Slipped N days. Commitment dailies live here on their own day. Arrows in: from plan day by PlacementRollover.sweep (second slip) and by clearPlan (the editor's No date); from auto by releaseAutoPlan when planDayIsAuto (Clear plan, a replan, a displacement); from overdue by TaskEditorSheet.apply and HomeTabView task_updates moving the due clock; from done by toggleCompletion (uncheck) and task_updates isComplete false." _blank
  click S_DAY href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L121" "planDay = startOfDay(intendedDate); plannedStartDate nil. In the Today lens when the day is today, else that day's lens (Tomorrow, This week, the calendar). planDayIsAuto says whether a planner wrote the day. Invariant I3: the day is today or later. Arrows in: from unplanned by setPlanDay (TaskEditorSheet.apply day picker or due-today rent rule, HomeTabView task_updates, PlacementRollover legacy plan item, backfillImportedScheduleOnce); from auto by releaseAutoPlan when the user chose the day, and by the rollover clearing a stale time; from manual by clearPlanTime (removeFromTimeline, the editor's day-only save, TimelineReflow no room, the rollover's stale time). The rollover's first slip keeps the row here: skipCount 1, setPlanDay(today)." _blank
  click S_AUTO href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L403" "Placed by DayPlanEngine.plan on today (auto: isToday) or by DayPlanRefiner.applyPlacements. intendedDate follows the start (setPlanStart). Drawn on the timeline; movable by the reflow (a pushed row keeps its auto flag); released by Clear plan, a replan or a displacement. Only today's placements are ever auto: a future-day run marks its placements manual. Arrows in from unplanned and plan day: planMyDay, autoPlanIfNewDay, the chat's plan intent through DayPlanRefiner." _blank
  click S_MANUAL href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L396" "A placement the user made, a started focus session, an imported entry with a span, or a planner run on a future day. Anchored: TimelineReflow never moves it, the planner plans around it, the arbiter's quiet-hours gate exempts placementLead and placementMissed for it. Arrows in by setPlanStart(auto: false): placeTask (timeline slot or drag), TaskEditorSheet.apply clock time, HomeTabView task_updates start time, TimelineReflow.sessionStarted (from SessionCoordinator.startSession), CalendarService import with a span, CalendarTabView.planSelectedDay on a future day. From auto the session start is drawn; placeTask and the editor make the same move." _blank
  click S_OVERDUE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L86" "isOverdue: open and sortDeadline (specificTime, else end of the due day) before now. Not written by anyone: the clock moves a dated row here and readers compute it. It overlays the plan states: a placed or planned task that is overdue stays where it is and also sits in the Overdue list (R3 overlap). Arrows out: TaskEditorSheet.apply (due picker, or a plan day set after the due day) and HomeTabView task_updates move the due clock; toggleCompletion, CompleteTaskIntent.perform and task_updates complete it; deleteTask, the editor's onDelete and CaptureWriter.apply's replace rule (a restated title) delete it. The completion and deletion arrows are drawn here once and apply to every open state." _blank
  click S_EVENT href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L391" "isInformationalEvent true. Anchor is specificTime (dueDate = its day, dueTime the label). Never carries a plan (I2). Shown on the Events tab, the timeline strip, the calendar and the widget; feeds the busy windows, the eventBlock nudge and the planner's buffers. Arrows in: CalendarService importAppleCalendar and writeICalEvents (drawn), ScreenshotCalendarImporter.importFromImage, CaptureWriter.apply with isEvent, setEventFlag on a task. setEventTime writes its time. Out: purgePastEvents once its day is over (drawn), the editor's onDelete, setEventFlag back to a task." _blank
  click S_DONE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Models/NudgeTask.swift#L381" "isComplete true, completedAt the instant. Arrows in from any open state: toggleCompletion (drawn), CompleteTaskIntent.perform in the widget, HomeTabView task_updates isComplete. The first two also insert a CompletedTaskRecord; the chat path does not. Out: toggleCompletion uncheck and task_updates isComplete false reopen it; deleteTask and the editor's onDelete delete it. Read as bucket 4 of TaskSortComparator, sunk to the bottom of the day lenses, kept in the widget for 7 days, excluded from every builder, planner, sweep and proposal; the rollover clears a past plan day on it." _blank
  click S_GONE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L1972" "modelContext.delete. Arrows in from any open state: deleteTask (drawn), the editor's onDelete (Tasks and Calendar), CaptureWriter.apply's replace rule, PlacementRollover.sweepMissedSessions, ExamPrepSweep (expanded parent, consumed quantity dailies), PlanProposalSweep.applyUserPlanOverrides; from events CalendarService.purgePastEvents (drawn). A generated row leaves a PrepTombstone; a CompletedTaskRecord survives." _blank
